8que :\n- Mangas\n- Webtoons\n- Bandes dessin\u00e9es\n- Comics\n\nModifiez l'environnement pour changer l'ambiance de vos lectures.\nUtilisez les contr\u00f4les Oculus Quest pour zoomer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NKus069WUYAQ7kNvwERWSPw&_nc_oc=AdqyT0OS2dqk4sM3TRjY_FUq5Nr9BheISwNCBn9zEbu1JdREh5ZNw2k_8uhHhWcs5qg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT0F2mgbIXTg_YaAanP03c9l9jC-J2SrV-2lRYpehRHNQ&oe=6B0065B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SfUL7BnNJCQQ7kNvwFefQYy&_nc_oc=Adqhbxkfql9X1_4B29A6W-kNUehnbWwZs5ZNxUNFmZK0_nltsErEg4Fv6t7afqTECOk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRK4uf_8VhVOtfIZh1v4-Dz8no_lmts88cfvZ0c1zEZVA&oe=6B006716"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ncPzeRWvqOsQ7kNvwE4s-92&_nc_oc=AdpOSBK3dh0-6ZZFfcA1x7bXYbDu6_jRII_O6fROvS0Z6Jtey5Xty